{"id":"murrain-a-disease-of-livestock","name":"Murrain (A Disease Of Livestock)","aliases":["Murrain"],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:murrain-a-disease-of-livestock"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Murrain","text":"Heb. deber, “destruction,” a “great mortality”, the fifth plague that fell upon the Egyptians (Ex. 9:3). It was some distemper that resulted in the sudden and widespread death of the cattle. It was confined to the cattle of the Egyptians that were in the field (9:6)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H1698","lemma":"דֶּבֶר","xlit":"deber","gloss":"a pestilence","kjv":"murrain, pestilence, plague","count":2,"share":0.67},{"strong":"H4735","lemma":"מִקְנֶה","xlit":"miqneh","gloss":"something bought","kjv":"cattle, flock, herd, possession","count":2,"share":0.67}],"verses":["Exod.9.3","Ps.78.50","Exod.9.6"],"related":[{"id":"plague-or-pestilence","type":"lexical","strong":"H1698","why":"both lead with דֶּבֶר (H1698)"},{"id":"cattle","type":"lexical","strong":"H4735","why":"both lead with מִקְנֶה (H4735)"},{"id":"tent","type":"lexical","strong":"H4735","why":"both lead with מִקְנֶה (H4735)"}],"works":[]}
